#: scenario:scenario_733932F8_99D6_4C79_AA66_A85288D2ABBB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 14b9386f3bf6f4c2fa7831a238388f9de209ce8f4bddfff1998a9d151ea0cd16
#. default-sha256: d9f86d366a9435f87f6335a63c67912f235843470e31d360f2919bd7c59ed741
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_733932F8_99D6_4C79_AA66_A85288D2ABBB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫The room with the fireplace was always kept in pristine "
"condition so they could entertain guests at any time."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫暖炉のある広間は、⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫来賓客のために常に美しく整えら"
"れています。"

#: scenario:scenario_93990DC2_AEFA_4178_8839_92F278F31293
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8147a5da8a16bf5c2f52f5417323c4f6a84405edba7a4d6da8e850e616791133
#. default-sha256: 0bcf65a21585674d2b736215be8f80be5f92789b8ef0f7f5ef1596925ae99be4
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_93990DC2_AEFA_4178_8839_92F278F31293"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Walls colorfully decorated with tapestries and stained-glass windows gave testament to their "
"great fortune."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫壁にかけられたタペストリーも、⟪k:1⟫色鮮やかな内壁も、⟪k:2⟫窓に嵌められた色硝子も、⟪k:3⟫すべて"
"は富の証拠でございました。"

#: scenario:scenario_C484908D_52F5_4594_95F3_954AECDEE522
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9978d556f2292e398874ffb3b39be08eea6b39625497f02dc4d3484ea204f827
#. default-sha256: e67ebe5d2f417594bf45c2423ec4f842ed294b713c7ea269c04ccbf4bb4fcc4a
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_C484908D_52F5_4594_95F3_954AECDEE522"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The servants’ first assignment every morning was to clean this room."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫何より使用人の朝一番の仕事は、⟪k:1⟫広間の清掃でございましたから。"

#: scenario:scenario_18E382B8_1ECB_4769_8786_65433954308B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a0200a6becabc17ec1d3b066aa75eb5a87835a061962397b9721d93bd0aada8a
#. default-sha256: 00350a9c7ba9bcc8394364ee43de2eedff5b669f493d118544374475e5efdd71
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_18E382B8_1ECB_4769_8786_65433954308B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Pitchers, silver plates, and silverware were polished to a shine so they could be proudly "
"put to use at a moment’s notice."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫水差しも、⟪k:1⟫銀の皿も、⟪k:2⟫食器も隅々まで磨かれて、⟪k:3⟫いつ誰が訪れても恥かしくないように"
"しております。"

#: scenario:scenario_EB3B5C9C_0AF1_4DC4_82C6_D50D1E9A46AC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 20186736f07bc8e66c96eac3653dafc46815310fe7f1eb32ab8768d1d4523bde
#. default-sha256: 2b96e4902978a32a416be97af44a3d2b9768cfbe67c24b6553e2aa1ff699d7b5
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_EB3B5C9C_0AF1_4DC4_82C6_D50D1E9A46AC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And for events like their daughter’s birthday, the room served an even more important role."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫更にご令嬢の誕生日会ともなれば、⟪k:1⟫広間の重要性は増していきますわ。"

#: scenario:scenario_D740EFB7_CD99_4401_8898_8761EF8F9271
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0bac10d54da10a98cf61f7cd17713fd974c70e531db919823ba1c8297d6a591e
#. default-sha256: 31aa741be94ee89f62e58574af3f005ebe0dc1f068a33ccffcdb68d8073af73b
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_D740EFB7_CD99_4401_8898_8761EF8F9271"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The tables’ tops were removable, so they had ordered new tabletops with designs made "
"especially for this occasion."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫テーブルの上板は取り外しが出来ましたから、⟪k:1⟫この日のために模様の施された新しいものを頼んで"
"おりました。"

#: scenario:scenario_B7CAB2CD_4031_4E6C_A8AF_D0F1F486DDCB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 70513ea4a5a8a86db7a00f81f62d5842865f85fc7b5e9f998d8f1aa0dbbea1c3
#. default-sha256: 70c2da63edacbdc3ca8cb4a4f52b00acb923bedd92b16ba996eb7c7de3c7dbec
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_B7CAB2CD_4031_4E6C_A8AF_D0F1F486DDCB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And once the banquet had drawn to a close, tables speckled with half-empty wine glasses and "
"leftover candied fruits were moved off to the side to make room for—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫of course—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫"
"the festivities."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫夕餉の時が過ぎれば、⟪k:1⟫いくらかのワイン、⟪k:2⟫砂糖漬けの果物を残したテーブルも、⟪k:3⟫脇によ"
"けて――⟪k:4⟫始まるのは、⟪k:5⟫勿論宴でございます。"

#: scenario:scenario_E4783BD9_F5CF_4FB4_8F58_D3C1BFC940DA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e3994039c11fa63ce59c09654fee3b2eeb0ec946268c1925d592b4a546391d80
#. default-sha256: 5038b93e683882d635c4b2b8f8b67c3cbeea5b65390854123954e9a36770fb31
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_E4783BD9_F5CF_4FB4_8F58_D3C1BFC940DA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Good evening, Lady Nellie!⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫You’re looking particularly lovely "
"today."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫やあ、⟪k:5⟫ミス・ネリー！⟪k:6⟫　今日も一段と麗しく……。"

#: scenario:scenario_BBFA0DBB_0B1F_4D9E_B286_7E65ADF5CEB8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e6bc95b434d3b415e767d6b7823b950688935eb1dc892262ec4e31d8f05324fe
#. default-sha256: db7d15ce9082183b1f7d1732ca0afd2735b7bdedbfe39885aff26338ef71b5a5
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_BBFA0DBB_0B1F_4D9E_B286_7E65ADF5CEB8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Nellie, I had these jewels cut just for you."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫ネリー、⟪k:1⟫君のために宝石を用意してきたんだ。"

#: scenario:scenario_836794CF_AE93_4D51_A19A_80F37CC09A07
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: eb0abc3bb195aff35895fb1c93361a1c4b9df0e6296e6f2e82c897990885e7e6
#. default-sha256: 71c85ab8afdb9856e0a344a6e20edbab21380dac14a2c735591358b01b8f0ae9
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_836794CF_AE93_4D51_A19A_80F37CC09A07"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫You’ll let me have this dance, won’t you?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫ダンスは勿論僕と踊ってくれるよね？"

#: scenario:scenario_8C08C1EF_FE48_40AD_AF4B_91277C0864D6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5750559954b5c3574d510b63c079d1290f6433eb2d04b266a60b9244c1cb9345
