msgctxt "scenario:scenario_8C08C1EF_FE48_40AD_AF4B_91277C0864D6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫............⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫Haaaaaaaahh..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫…………っ、⟪k:19⟫はあぁあ～～～。"

#: scenario:scenario_1ADB677C_2191_42BE_8E2F_65AE3D6B334A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 57b35ea3f76f0945a870d266160efda4c35927edde8fdb9bd487a6ab4b843f3d
#. default-sha256: 967adf444263a38f931c5c3cf475521fe0296e56a82d539769cab7414c62fd89
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_1ADB677C_2191_42BE_8E2F_65AE3D6B334A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫What’s the matter, Nellie?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫You look exhausted."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫あれ、⟪k:2⟫ネリー。⟪k:3⟫どうしたの、⟪k:4⟫そんなぐったりして。"

#: scenario:scenario_25B59912_86D9_4430_A5F0_DB07F0529EDC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2be362f813fc709a3cd950b7a97e19ba6e50e3bca37f34aa14c424ed28b9f734
#. default-sha256: 555783e1c3aaeae75b5cecde2a8e892b514ad3dd3039b2e1b0c5b7207ad113d8
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_25B59912_86D9_4430_A5F0_DB07F0529EDC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫These are pretty good.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Want one? ⟪k:5⟫I know you like sweets.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫"
"They’re apples candied in rock sugar, I think."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫これおいしーよ。⟪k:3⟫食べる？⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫石砂糖で漬けこんだ林檎みたいだけど……。⟪k:6⟫"
"甘いもの好きだろ？"

#: scenario:scenario_DA8B5329_49DB_4C6C_923F_FEDFDFE8DDA8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a76513d69ef9eb0e1a254c72450390f96c3292d9bbb93b2f20652f232ad39b0f
#. default-sha256: ef04521a0dd64feede15d522feddc69a64e85945eac2e1c48c4972c1a0e04e5a
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_DA8B5329_49DB_4C6C_923F_FEDFDFE8DDA8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You disappoint me, dearest Mell."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫呆れるわ、⟪k:2⟫おにいさま……。"

#: scenario:scenario_149349B0_AE96_4EFA_889E_E106147B1CB6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 113a9c0cb8419b8f7275c7bb00310efb525911cd04e0f5b6f2936b45fc362348
#. default-sha256: 6b2bda218b380325ff6e4046aa45e6b53968eeeeaf71196852ee09a136c2261b
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_149349B0_AE96_4EFA_889E_E106147B1CB6"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Er?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫えっ。"

#: scenario:scenario_68B11AA6_DD4F_4AF3_93EE_E20CEE066B19
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9a2bf836b55426d82c97038b9ab752253254b0448f89e66077dfda8c4b23a7bd
#. default-sha256: 9abf520f5d4d1c72b64e4de5580c3f87d4b734b576c4093f0a7d89a306bd50e7
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_68B11AA6_DD4F_4AF3_93EE_E20CEE066B19"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫What do you ⟪k:2⟫think⟪k:3⟫ is the matter?!⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫They just keep ⟪k:6⟫coming⟪k:7⟫. "
"It never ⟪k:8⟫ends⟪k:9⟫."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫どうしたもこうしたも無いわよ！⟪k:2⟫　次から次へと、⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫ほんっとキリがない……。"

#: scenario:scenario_1AB4B92C_FA3A_45DE_9E53_EC773E8EE5DD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ca755ed7d2e49118a27837af65ee92765f1232b4924685a25c866e98bd6d4bb8
#. default-sha256: 450f5c50dbde9553c294471d4c11e84aca004c844ccf43e4b76843eaba24f386
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_1AB4B92C_FA3A_45DE_9E53_EC773E8EE5DD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫It’s driving me up the wall.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Everyone’s just repeating the same lines they’ve "
"been taught.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫They all think pretty jewels and requests to dance are enough to make a "
"girl swoon."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫お決まりの言葉ばっかりで、⟪k:2⟫いやんなっちゃう。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫綺麗な宝石とダンスのお誘いが"
"あれば、⟪k:5⟫女がなびくと思ってるのよ！"

#: scenario:scenario_C20CD433_B0CD_417B_B181_C24666F35234
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 794ff6fd822bc4dc6044a1e7a8ec0380a17bfab1fc80a12cfd274551f0e81b41
#. default-sha256: ee7a7d265c952531727ceff175a9c3fc7629f667df80b89430a0c08df523d997
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_C20CD433_B0CD_417B_B181_C24666F35234"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫(But I think that ⟪k:2⟫is⟪k:3⟫ true for you, Nellie.)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫（実際、⟪k:2⟫ネリーはそうだと思うんだけどなあ）"

#: scenario:scenario_BA226F13_9347_408F_AC5B_C26B4A5BDFB0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3b6badfb21e30695e5053b84e51bbef21b9ea8513be1c117914d169049ea035f
#. default-sha256: a0495a52702735316a7cf96f7b7557ddcfebdd6f7838bef4f6694dec237ebddf
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_BA226F13_9347_408F_AC5B_C26B4A5BDFB0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫(Though... ⟪k:2⟫why is she disappointed with me?)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫（ていうか、⟪k:2⟫僕に呆れたのか……？）"

#: scenario:scenario_4E973416_1EE7_46FA_86CD_CB839058D2EE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8208a272b73176c5bf18426f1f3da76fb0f6f2c7a0be635c0741be5de0fb826f
#. default-sha256: b8bd93eac3923f56626e185f197827ce5f41e1ef383ea37653e59df13c7e86ff
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_4E973416_1EE7_46FA_86CD_CB839058D2EE"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Uggggh, I think I’m done with birthday parties after this year."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫もう～、⟪k:2⟫やっぱり誕生日会なんて来年からはやめてもらうわ。"

#: scenario:scenario_F4C7CEBA_FFC0_4989_80F1_0B18359A4581
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8aad119add9851b9c46bd478191305796ed6eeddc248579f07fbd9654c8f05b3
#. default-sha256: a983a5121d53aac3ed3f3a6eca9b8f59e083f0e0a4bd1c4d3d389da2e775551f
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_F4C7CEBA_FFC0_4989_80F1_0B18359A4581"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫They’ll probably throw an even bigger one next year."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫来年はもっと大きくなるんじゃない？"

#: scenario:scenario_CD0AD072_93C9_4C07_88DF_F34C115B1CF6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2fcb0eed7057813e7ee8acbffc5529b2de12653f3821f3990e22739fd58aad64
