msgctxt "scenario:scenario_CD0AD072_93C9_4C07_88DF_F34C115B1CF6"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Huh? ⟪k:2⟫Why?!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫ええっ、⟪k:2⟫どうして！？"

#: scenario:scenario_DCB893DC_6670_47A0_BD44_6606BE247DA5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 983fb46963e5962fb290166bb1d71e460edde7d5a5c197edf989d093b1e9c91c
#. default-sha256: 0f06cb698cf325487b72c4b8c1d745c287f31390ccb7a5843441445c47adb0fd
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_DCB893DC_6670_47A0_BD44_6606BE247DA5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Well, you know.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫You’re... ⟪k:4⟫about that age, Nellie."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫まあ、⟪k:2⟫ほら……ネリーもそろそろ、⟪k:3⟫そういう歳だし。"

#: scenario:scenario_58E28F15_FFFB_40BB_8FD0_F0A7225EED44
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 89bba9d121c5b501f6596e39834b290bf305c65e10b284e0d96c55b046f94929
#. default-sha256: 59f1d267eec8ab635d202bafa9713a0dc0e0dfbd92f8f90893d48a43caeb83ee
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_58E28F15_FFFB_40BB_8FD0_F0A7225EED44"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫We ⟪k:1⟫are⟪k:2⟫ a reasonably distinguished family,⟪k:3⟫so there are a number of different "
"houses⟪k:4⟫that would like to have connections with us."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫うちはそこそこ良い家柄だから、⟪k:1⟫繋がりを持ちたいと思っているところも、⟪k:2⟫多いよ。"

#: scenario:scenario_C5D088F7_7505_40FF_A12D_242ABC9EEE1F
